{"id": "62804", "title": "媚色倾国", "author": "茵梦", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 25, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/62/62804.htm", "intro": "在元魏皇室之中，兰陵郡主独孤毓灵绝对是朵奇葩。\r\n她出生高贵，却声名狼藉。与她有染的男人，没有一百也有好几十；与她保持长期关系的情人，没有几十也不会少于十个。\r\n是她天生　，还是伤心人别有怀抱？\r\n然而纵是万花丛中纵横，云海之巅沉浮，为何心底深处总有空虚寂寞，遗恨难平？\r\n当岁月轮回，繁华落尽，谁与我携手并肩，共赏江山如画，坐看云起云落？", "base": "files/article/html/62/62804", "chapters": [{"title": "1-8", "file": "9320123.html", "available": false}, {"title": "916", "file": "9320126.html", "available": false}, {"title": "17-27", "file": "9320127.html", "available": false}, {"title": "28-37", "file": "9320129.html", "available": false}, {"title": "38-46", "file": "9320130.html", "available": false}, {"title": "47-56", "file": "9320133.html", "available": false}, {"title": "57-64", "file": "9320135.html", "available": false}, {"title": "65-73", "file": "9320137.html", "available": false}, {"title": "74-81", "file": "9320139.html", "available": false}, {"title": "82-87", "file": "9320140.html", "available": false}, {"title": "88-94", "file": "9320141.html", "available": false}, {"title": "95-100", "file": "9320144.html", "available": false}, {"title": "101-106", "file": "9320146.html", "available": false}, {"title": "107-113", "file": "9320149.html", "available": false}, {"title": "114-120", "file": "9320150.html", "available": false}, {"title": "121-128", "file": "9320151.html", "available": false}, {"title": "129-137", "file": "9320153.html", "available": false}, {"title": "138-146", "file": "9320158.html", "available": false}, {"title": "147-154", "file": "9320159.html", "available": false}, {"title": "155-163", "file": "9320160.html", "available": false}, {"title": "164-172", "file": "9320163.html", "available": false}, {"title": "173-180", "file": "9320164.html", "available": false}, {"title": "181-188", "file": "9320167.html", "available": false}, {"title": "189-196", "file": "9320169.html", "available": false}, {"title": "197-200完结", "fil